{title: This I Believe (The Creed) (FJ_131_en)}
{song_number: 131}
{language: en}
{artist: Matt Crocker and Ben Fielding}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Our Father everlasting, the [C]all creating One,
[Em]God Al[D]mighty.
[G]Through Your Holy Spirit conceiving [C]Christ the Son,
[Em]Jesus our [D]Saviour.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]Our judge and our defender, suffered [C]and crucified;
[Em]forgiveness is [D]in You.
[G]Descended into darkness, You rose [C]in glorious life,
[Em]forever seated [D]high.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[G]I believe in God our [Am]Father, I be[C]lieve in Christ the [D]Son.
[G]I believe in the Holy [Am]Spirit, our [C]God is three in [D]One.
[G]I believe in the resur[Am]rection, that [C]we will rise a[D]gain.
[Em]For I believe in the [C]Name of [D]Jesus, [C]Name of [D]Jesus.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[G]I be[C]lieve in You, [Em]I be[D]lieve You rose again.
[G]I be[C]lieve that [Em]Jesus [D]Christ is Lord.
[G]I be[C]lieve in the [D]Name of [G]Jesus.
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Ending}
[G]I believe in life e[Am]ternal, [C]I believe in the virgin [D]birth.
[G]I believe in the saints' com[Am]munion and [C]in Your Holy [D]Church.
[G]I believe in the resur[Am]rection, [C]when Jesus comes a[D]gain.
[Em]For I believe in the [C]Name of [D]Jesus.
{end_of_verse}
